</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>In Thy dear hand I’m resting,</l><l>Oh, hold me quiet there;</l><l>Then soften me and mould me,</l><l>And for Thy will prepare.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>I need not fear to trust Thee,</l><l>Thy love and skill are such,</l><l>New lessons Thou wilt teach me,</l><l>While yielding to Thy touch.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Impress Thine image on me,</l><l>Fulfil Thy blest design,</l><l>Till others see upon me</l><l>That beauteous face of Thine.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
